    "The cutoff is a provisional market benchmark, not a confirmed company decision time. The challenge does not name an exchange or give the client's internal decision schedule. 09:20 Europe/London on D-1 is used as a conservative hourly day-ahead gate benchmark; confirm the client's exchange and internal deadline before operational use.",
